      "answerIndex": 1,
      "answerSource": "derived",
      "answerKeyRef": null,
      "explanation": "The park has side √169 = 13 m. An outside path 2 m wide adds 4 m to each total dimension, so the outer square has side 17 m. Path area = 17² − 13² = 289 − 169 = 120 m². Verified solution (unofficial); original printed paper and worked derivation checked on 26 October 2026.",
